      "statement": "chdman features degrade on version as well as presence: MIN_DREAMCAST_VERSION = \"0.264\" gates CHD conversion for systems whose name contains Dreamcast, and MIN_SPLITBIN_VERSION = \"0.265\" gates any multi-track CD CHD, with callers comparing the probe string via Ordering::Less and skipping the game with a warning instead of issuing a command the installed tool cannot run.",
