      "id": "claim_104cc73b81704ef3a56a511482cf3167",
      "statement": "info.rs (Dependencies section), query.rs (GraphQL dependencies) and mcp/read.rs (status tool and oxyromon://status resource) each call every module's get_version() at request time with no cache, rendering Ok as the version and Err as \"not found\"/null; only chdman and ctrtool can fail, since in-process backends return the literal \"built-in\" (nsz appending \", prod.keys not found\").",
