    {
      "id": "claim_48b10727a83d42fa96168f6e34f4f2cc",
      "statement": "There is no setting that names a tool path or overrides ${PATH}: the executable name is a compile-time constant in each format module (const CHDMAN, const CTRTOOL). Per-system CHD_CD/DVD/HD/LD_COMPRESSION_ALGORITHMS, *_HUNK_SIZE (validated against CHD_HUNK_SIZE_RANGE 16..1048576) and CHD_PARENTS are read by convert_roms/export_roms and passed into the module as plain parameters that become chdman argv.",
