      "id": "claim_4669a970c9e94f0ea4f9e2f7d3fd80f6",
      "statement": "CI's single dependency step runs apt-get update with retries and installs mame-tools (which provides chdman) plus xdelta3; xdelta3 is not a runtime dependency at all — crates/xdelta-rs is in-process, and the binary exists only for tests/interop.rs, which probes `xdelta3 -V` and skips when it is absent.",
