      "statement": "Tests that need an external tool skip rather than fail when it is unusable: import_roms/test_cia.rs returns early on ctrtool::get_version().is_err() (ctrtool is never installed in CI, so the CIA path is untested on the runner), and multi-track CHD tests return early when the installed chdman compares less than MIN_SPLITBIN_VERSION.",
